                    given: "Source distances \\( d_1 = 3.20\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), \\( d_2 = 4.00\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), Wavelength \\( \\lambda = 0.40\\,\\mathrm{m} \\).",
                    find: "Path difference (\\( d_2 - d_1 \\)), order (\\( n \\)), and interference state.",
