                    given: "Current \\( I = 40\\,\\mathrm{A} \\), Distance \\( d = 0.080\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), \\( \\mu_0 = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7}\\,\\mathrm{T\\cdot m/A} \\).",
