                    find: "Resonant frequency (\\( f_0 \\)) in \\( \\mathrm{Hz} \\), total energy (\\( E_{CL} \\)) in \\( \\mathrm{mJ} \\), and peak current (\\( I_m \\)) in \\( \\mathrm{A} \\).",
