                    given: "Mass \\( m = 0.40\\,\\mathrm{kg} \\), Length \\( L = 1.50\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), \\( \\theta_0 = 60.0^\\circ \\), \\( g = 9.80\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2} \\).",
